#15=IFCAUDIOVISUALAPPLIANCE('0_lvB97XbVehSvasMc$0RF',#5,'12 Gauge Microphones Green12','The Green12 is a Cardioid electret condenser microphone built into a spent Remington 12-gauge shotgun shell.\X2\000A\X0\The capsule is a small electret model, with onboard FET. The mic\X2\2019\X0\s circuit is transformerless, transistorless, and unbalanced. It requires phantom power. The acoustic vents required by the mic\X2\2019\X0\s Cardioid polar pattern are carved into the brass casing of the shotgun shell.\X2\000A\X0\All 12 Gauge microphones are built by hand by Brad Martin, the company founder, who buys and shoots the ammunition for','Cardioid Condenser Microphone',#12,$,'Green12',.MICROPHONE.);
